    /**
     * Stores {@code value} under {@code key} only if the key is absent, atomically at the
     * key's partition owner, with the same TTL put gives it. Returns the value bound to
     * {@code key} afterwards: the existing value if one was already there (nothing is
     * written), otherwise {@code value}.
